Business context: FCMConector is the bridge between the TOMI payment tables and the FCM (financial-crime / sanctions-screening) engine over Apache ActiveMQ. A defect here either stalls payments in a screening status or lets them proceed with a wrong status, so the status-handling findings (FR-2, FR-3, FR-5, FR-6) are the priority.
