FCM-FR-28 (Minor) - `async` methods without `await` and sync NMS calls. InsertaMensajesFCMAsync is async but contains no await (blocking producer.Send, RepositorioTomi.cs:298-330), CrearConexionApacheNMSActiveMQAsync returns Task.FromResult after blocking network I/O (:47-96), and CierraConexionApacheNMSActiveMQAsync wraps the close in Task.Run (:105-125). The Apache.NMS API is synchronous by contract, so this is a naming/CS1998 issue rather than a defect; use sync methods (or return Task.FromResult explicitly) and drop the Async suffix, or run the blocking section on a worker thread deliberately. Also MapConnectionError is a public class in the global namespace using culture-sensitive ToLower() (MapConnectionError.cs:13); use StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase and a namespace. Suggested JIRA: FCM-28 (Minor).
